     [EINVAL]           _c_m_d does not specify a valid command.

     [EINVAL]           _f_l_a_g_s is not 0.

     [EPERM]            An attempt was made to use
                        MEMBARRIER_CMD_GLOBAL_EXPEDITED,
                        MEMBARRIER_CMD_PRIVATE_EXPEDITED, or
