SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The mmeemmbbaarrrriieerr system call originated in Linux.  This implementation aims
     to be source-compatible with the Linux implementation.  Certain _c_m_d and
     _f_l_a_g_s values are currently not supported by FreeBSD.

